RAW FILE REPOSITORY FOR 895070

These files are used directly on the 895070.com website and are automatically
generated as part of the platform’s data pipeline.

- The Showcase JSON file is generated from user requests submitted through
  the Google Form provided on the website.
- The Traffic JSON file is generated using data collected from external
  services.
- The Wall JSON file is generated from data scraped and analyzed by our
  internal agents.

Approximately 99% of the overall process is automated. However, all data
is reviewed and verified by a human before it is published.
